but the thing is
They'd say it.

00:52:58.400 --> 00:53:00.740
Because what we're
talking about is I think

00:53:00.740 --> 00:53:05.650
in America there is this
distrust of authority,

00:53:05.650 --> 00:53:07.750
which is a good thing, right,

00:53:07.750 --> 00:53:11.900
