00:53:13.610 --> 00:53:16.190
So the whole idea of
questioning authority,

00:53:16.190 --> 00:53:19.320
people have talked like you
could never do a lockdown

00:53:19.320 --> 00:53:21.920
in the US like you did in
China because we don't have

00:53:21.920 --> 00:53:23.320
