00:53:32.450 --> 00:53:34.300
And so I think that
that's a healthy thing,

00:53:34.300 --> 00:53:38.170
I think that questioning authority,

00:53:38.170 --> 00:53:42.260
there's a healthy,
positive place for that.

00:53:42.260 --> 00:53:46.240
But in the past generation or so,

00:53:46.240 --> 00:53:50.360
