00:54:19.610 --> 00:54:21.830
And you know what happened,
that week is the week

00:54:21.830 --> 00:54:23.690
that it was like, oh,
now we've got clusters,

00:54:23.690 --> 00:54:25.480
we've got community spread.

00:54:25.480 --> 00:54:28.000
Is he a prophet, does
