gonna claim to know about it,

00:54:51.500 --> 00:54:55.010
I haven't read these books,
I haven't studied this,

00:54:55.010 --> 00:54:58.980
but I can recognize when someone has

00:54:58.980 --> 00:55:01.830
and understand that, oh,
they're all saying basically

00:55:01.830 --> 00:55:04.980
the same thing, there may
be a range of projections,

00:55:04.980 --> 00:55:06.820
but they're all basically
saying the same thing.

00:55:06.820 --> 00:55:08.210
They're all saying this is gonna seem

00:55:08.210 --> 00:55:10.540
like we're overreacting,
but just trust us,

00:55:10.540 --> 00:55:11.880
these things operate according

00:55:11.880 --> 00:55:15.160
