But can any positive come from this?

00:56:56.410 --> 00:56:57.243
I think that's--

00:56:57.243 --> 00:56:58.943
Well, of course, yeah, yeah.

00:57:01.650 --> 00:57:03.870
A couple people have, this
isn't something I came up with,

00:57:03.870 --> 00:57:07.183
a number of people have
made this connection,

00:57:08.360 --> 00:57:11.310
but this is there's very little difference

