01:02:38.920 --> 01:02:40.770
a support structure to continue to be

01:02:42.560 --> 01:02:45.390
a contributing part of
the economy and society

01:02:45.390 --> 01:02:49.680
and for their livelihood
not to disintegrate.

01:02:49.680 --> 01:02:51.300
So it's just you're gonna
spend a lot of money

01:02:51.300 --> 01:02:55.360
to fix this problem of COVID-19,

01:02:55.360 --> 01:02:57.780
is there gonna be any
money left over to spend

01:02:57.780 --> 01:03:00.860
on this initiative that like, by the way,

01:03:00.860 --> 01:03:02.870
it's not something that's
predicted that might happen,

01:03:02.870 --> 01:03:05.190
it also is happening.

01:03:05.190 --> 01:03:07.140
That's something, again,

01:03:07.140 --> 01:03:09.340
the president keeps saying
hopefully this won't

01:03:09.340 --> 01:03:13.560
happen again for centuries,
it's like, dude, what?

01:03:13.560 --> 01:03:15.680
It's going to happen
again, we knew that it was

01:03:15.680 --> 01:03:17.740
going to happen, they said
it was going to happen,

01:03:17.740 --> 01:03:19.340
and it will happen again.

